    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into danger, sharpen your blade, and test your skill.</strong> <br>  <br><strong>The Treasure Below</strong> is a fast-paced action game with stylized medieval  visuals, designed for players who crave satisfying melee combat and ever-increasing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a <strong>variety of weapons</strong>, each with unique attacks and skills\u2014fast moving swords, long reaching polearms, heavy-hitting great axes, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Mode</strong> puts your skill to the test: fight through escalating <strong>waves of monsters</strong>, each deadlier than the last. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll earn access to <strong>greater rewards</strong> and tougher challenges.<br><br>[<strong>Exploration Mode</strong> coming soon \u2013 Descend into dangerous dungeons and uncover ancient treasures in a series of handcrafted levels.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>Online Co-op</strong> coming soon \u2013 Team up with a friend to take on monsters together. No PvP\u2014just pure cooperative action.]<br><br>There\u2019s <strong>no story, no lore, no cutscenes</strong>\u2014just pure gameplay. Jump in, gear up, and see how far you can go.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into danger, sharpen your blade, and test your skill.</strong> <br>  <br><strong>The Treasure Below</strong> is a fast-paced action game with stylized medieval  visuals, designed for players who crave satisfying melee combat and ever-increasing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a <strong>variety of weapons</strong>, each with unique attacks and skills\u2014fast moving swords, long reaching polearms, heavy-hitting great axes, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Mode</strong> puts your skill to the test: fight through escalating <strong>waves of monsters</strong>, each deadlier than the last. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll earn access to <strong>greater rewards</strong> and tougher challenges.<br><br>[<strong>Exploration Mode</strong> coming soon \u2013 Descend into dangerous dungeons and uncover ancient treasures in a series of handcrafted levels.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>Online Co-op</strong> coming soon \u2013 Team up with a friend to take on monsters together. No PvP\u2014just pure cooperative action.]<br><br>There\u2019s <strong>no story, no lore, no cutscenes</strong>\u2014just pure gameplay. Jump in, gear up, and see how far you can go.</p>",
